# DEFECT 1 — three of the four `open` statements name files that do not exist.
# Every `open` below requests
#     ..._relaxed_rank_001_alphafold2_ptm_model_1_seed_000.pdb
# but ColabFold ranks models per prediction, and the rank_001 model number
# differs for every candidate. Verified against the deposited output in
# ../structures/:
#
#     candidate         script expects    actually exists
#     MSTRG_4687_1      model_1           model_5     <-- does not exist
#     MSTRG_45757_2     model_1           model_1     <-- correct
#     MSTRG_6647_1      model_1           model_3     <-- does not exist
#     MSTRG_45758_1     model_1           model_3     <-- does not exist
#
# ChimeraX will fail on the first missing file. The script therefore CANNOT
# have produced the renders it names, and those renders are not deposited:
# see DEFECT 3.
#
# DEFECT 2 — MSTRG_31255_1, the lead candidate, is never opened. No figure
# this script produces can depict it.
#
# DEFECT 3 — the outputs it names (MSTRG_*_pLDDT.png, MSTRG_*_vs_rice.png,
# all_4_proteins_overview.png, four *_spin.mp4) no longer exist anywhere.
# Six renamed PNGs (image1-image6) did survive, but their subject could never
# be established and none of them can show the lead candidate, so they were
# REMOVED from this package on 28 August 2026 rather than deposited
# unattributable. See ../docs/VERIFICATION.md section 1.4.
#
# DEFECT 4 — all paths are absolute Windows paths under C:\Users\Joshua\.
# The ColabFold folders were moved to D:\Downloads D\ on 5 August 2026 and are
# deposited here under ../structures/. Repoint the script there to use it.
# These absolute paths are retained deliberately as provenance — they are the
# documentary evidence for the relocation recorded in docs/MANIFEST.md section 9.4 —
# and the account name they contain is the author's own.
#
# THIS SCRIPT IS NOT THE RECORD OF THE PREDICTION SETTINGS.
# An earlier version of docs/MANIFEST.md claimed it was. That claim was wrong
# and has been withdrawn. The authoritative record is
#     ../structures/<candidate>/config.json
# which carries the ColabFold version and commit, model type, MSA mode,
# recycle count, seed, ranking metric and relaxation parameters, and
#     ../structures/<candidate>/log.txt
# which records the per-model pLDDT/pTM and the actual final ranking.
